          "text": [
            "<h3>Situation A. Serena, Rashida and Omar’s Strategies</h3><p>Some students in Summit Heights Middle School used different strategies to answer the question “which cost plan is the better deal?” Explain how each strategy would or would not work to decide which cost plan is the best",
