      {
        "id": "TILEAWUDtwks4sG-",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>For the following equations students used different strategies to solve each equation for a given value of one of the variables.</p><ul><li><strong>Equation 1</strong> y = -x + 6 &nbsp;What is x if y = 4?</li><li><strong>Equation 2</strong> y = 5x - 3 &nbsp;What is y if x = 4?</li></ul><p>Which of the following strategies go with each equation?</p>"
          ]
